  "description": "<p style=\"language: fr; line-height: 120%; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0in; text-align: center; direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: embed; mso-line-break-override: none; word-break: normal; punctuation-wrap: hanging;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16pt; font-family: 'Montserrat SemiBold'; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\">Produits d&rsquo;herboristerie</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"language: fr; line-height: 120%; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0in; text-align: center; direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: embed; mso-line-break-override: none; word-break: normal; punctuation-wrap: hanging;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16pt; font-family: 'Montserrat SemiBold'; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\">BIO, fabriqu&eacute;s en France, formul&eacute;s par un Pharmacien herboriste</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"language: fr; line-height: 120%; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0in; text-align: center; direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: embed; mso-line-break-override: none; word-break: normal; punctuation-wrap: hanging;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16pt; font-family: 'Montserrat SemiBold'; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\"></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"language: fr; line-height: 120%; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0in; text-align: center; direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: embed; mso-line-break-override: none; word-break: normal; punctuation-wrap: hanging;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16pt; font-family: 'Montserrat SemiBold'; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\"></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"language: fr; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0in; text-align: center; direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: embed; mso-line-break-override: none; word-break: normal; punctuation-wrap: hanging;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Montserrat Thin'; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Revisit&eacute;e &agrave; l'aune d'une prise de conscience globale, L&rsquo;Officine Immortelle a puis&eacute; dans les grimoires et dans les bienfaits de la phyto-aromath&eacute;rapie&nbsp;pour entretenir et am&eacute;liorer&nbsp;notre capital sant&eacute; et bien-&ecirc;tre.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"language: fr; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0in; text-align: center; direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: embed; mso-line-break-override: none; word-break: normal; punctuation-wrap: hanging;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Montserrat Thin'; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">La marque remet ainsi au go&ucirc;t du jour des formules ancestrales &agrave; base de plantes &agrave; travers ses &eacute;lixirs, vitamines, tisanes et huiles de soin.</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Montserrat Thin'; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"language: fr; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0in; text-align: center; direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: embed; mso-line-break-override: none; word-break: normal; punctuation-wrap: hanging;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Montserrat Thin'; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"language: fr; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0in; text-align: center; direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: embed; mso-line-break-override: none; word-break: normal; punctuation-wrap: hanging;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Montserrat Thin'; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"language: fr; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0in; text-align: center; direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: embed; mso-line-break-override: none; word-break: normal; punctuation-wrap: hanging;\"></p>",
